Workflow-command annotations for inline PR review.

```
$ aplan check --format github
? 1
::error file=aplan/tasks/B-001.md,title=APLAN003 B-001::`blocked_by` references unknown task `GHOST`
::error file=aplan/tasks/B-001.md,title=APLAN005 B-001::`status: done` with no `evidence`: a status is a claim, not a proof

```

SARIF 2.1.0, so the same report lands in a code-scanning dashboard. The rule
catalog is every rule aplan has, not just the ones that fired, so a `ruleId`
always resolves to something a dashboard can explain.

```
$ aplan check --format sarif
? 1
